                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Great workout! Simple but nice!\nI think I lost couple of pounds on my first session :D When you hear the monster right besides you,  you get this adrenaline rush and you start running even faster. Love that feeling. Also it's cool that I can run forward and look behind to see where the monster is.\nHolding the grip to run was a bit uncomfortable at first, so you have to get use to it (update on that would be a good thing).\n\nReally looking forward on what the developers have to offer in the future.",
